//   TextReader      - what the picture says (OCR)
//
// Rules (same spirit as svir.proto):
//   * Changes are ADDITIVE only. Never renumber or retype a field.
//   * Boxes are normalised 0..1, origin top-left, x/y = top-left corner, w/h = size.
//     This is the same convention as SVIR's BBox, so Go copies them straight across.
//   * The server never sees timestamps or frame ids except to echo them back; all
